# MOD, the voices' generative modulation: a voice's page button pressed again opens it (from the pad, the bells and
# the bass, never from the other pages); SELECT reaches it after Setup; its knobs, kept with the piece
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 1
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 7
shot mod.png
turn K1 3 10
expect par28 23
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 2
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 7
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 3
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 7
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 4
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
tap GLO
wait 100
turn SELECT 1 100
expect view 7
turn K4 4 10
expect par31 4
wav mod.wav
wait 20000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
